# Browser-visible settings only. Never place GEMINI_API_KEY or threat-intel keys here.
#
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL as the relative path: in development Vite proxies
# /api to FastAPI (vite.config.js), and in production FastAPI serves the built
# app on the same origin. A cross-origin URL would need CORS for the officer
# Authorization header and PATCH requests.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
